      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "完蛋了完蛋了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8C86CB4E865B8C86CB4E86FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的車輪毬在路上狂衝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176848ECA8F2A6BEC57288DEF4E0A72C2885DFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣下去……\n說不定會撞上人或寶可夢！？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A234E0B53BB20262026000A8AAA4E0D5B9A6703649E4E0A4EBA62165BF653EF5922FF01FF1F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！\n用對戰讓我的車輪毬停下來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF01000A75285C0D62308B93621176848ECA8F2A6BEC505C4E0B4F865427FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吭吭嗯～！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542D542D55EFFF5EFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "吭吭。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542D542D30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太好了！\n牠終於停下來了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A597D4E86FF01000A72607D4265BC505C4E0B4F864E863002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然讓車輪毬在城市裡亂衝，\n這到底是打算想怎麼樣！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ADF71368B938ECA8F2A6BEC572857CE5E0288E14E82885DFF0C000A901952305E95662F62537B9760F3600E9EBC6A23FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有人在生氣呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094EBA5728751F6C2354623002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "目標是與野生寶可夢的共生，\n訴求是廢除野生特區。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我，就是正義社的成員。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76EE6A19662F820791CE751F5BF653EF592276845171751FFF0C000A8A346C42662F5EE2966491CE751F72795340300200100001BE00000A6211FF0C5C31662F6B637FA9793E7684621054E1300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是故意讓車輪毬在城市裡亂衝，\n想藉此大肆宣傳寶可夢的危險性，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然後否定正義社的理念嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F6545610F8B938ECA8F2A6BEC572857CE5E0288E14E82885DFF0C000A60F385C96B64592780865BA350B35BF653EF59227684537196AA6027FF0C00100001BE00000A71365F8C54265B9A6B637FA9793E768474065FF555CEFF1F00100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是！\n不是的！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662FFF01000A4E0D662F7684FF01FF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是車輪毬牠突然瘋狂旋轉起來，\n然後就一股腦兒地衝出去了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8ECA8F2A6BEC72607A817136760B72C265CB8F498D774F86FF0C000A71365F8C5C314E0080A1816651525730885D51FA53BB4E863002001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一絲一毫都沒有\n要否定正義社的意思！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E007D724E006BEB90FD6C926709000A898154265B9A6B637FA9793E7684610F601DFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就算你沒那個意思，\n讓寶可夢做出危險的事，就是給我們添麻煩！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C317B974F606C9290A3500B610F601DFF0C000A8B935BF653EF5922505A51FA537196AA76844E8BFF0C5C31662F7D66621150116DFB9EBB7169FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓我紮紮實實地教你認識\n正義社的厲害吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B9362117D2E7D2E5BE65BE6573065594F608A8D8B58000A6B637FA9793E768453B25BB35427FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什……教我認識……？\n我膽小又怕痛，不要啦……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC020262026655962118A8D8B5820262026FF1F000A621181BD5C0F53C8601575DBFF0C4E0D8981556620262026001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第一是要熟知寶可夢！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C4E00662F8981719F77E55BF653EF5922FF0100100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "車輪毬出乎意料地具有攻擊性，\n一有什麼事就會高速旋轉然後去撞擊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ECA8F2A6BEC51FA4E4E610F6599573051776709653B64CA6027FF0C000A4E0067094EC09EBC4E8B5C3167039AD8901F65CB8F4971365F8C53BB649E64CA300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是登峰級別夠高，\n寶可夢也會順從訓練家的指示，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但要是級別不夠高……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F767B5CF07D1A522559209AD8FF0C000A5BF653EF59224E5F670398065F9E8A137DF45BB676846307793AFF0C00100001BE00000A4F468981662F7D1A52254E0D59209AD82026202600100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就到正義社鍛鍊一番，\n好讓自己能獨力制止車輪毬吧！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就是這樣了！失陪。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3152306B637FA9793E935B934A4E00756AFF0C000A597D8B9381EA5DF180FD7368529B52366B628ECA8F2A6BEC5427FF0100100001BE00000A5C31662F90196A234E86FF015931966A300200100002011401A20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝、謝謝！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D30018B1D8B1DFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……這麼一來，到時是會在\n傳說中的皙白的指導下修行嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202690199EBC4E004F86FF0C52306642662F67035728000A50B38AAA4E2D76847699767D768463075C0E4E0B4FEE884C55CEFF1F001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃～\n那也很傷腦筋啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5443FF5E000A90A34E5F5F8850B781667B4B554AFF01001000020114017A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
