      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了要和搭檔寶可夢好好相處，\n我身為一個訓練家<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也必須要有所成長才行哪。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕź",
